      {
        "id": "1640e3d6-3870-412a-8a46-9a3b370dbaf3",
        "title": "Art Style",
        "body": "The fish-headed humanoid character reminds me of <em style=\"background-color: rgb(207, 255, 0);\">Splatoon</em>. I think this visual style is very suitable for this game, so I may draw some inspirations from <em>Splatoon in the aspect of art design</em>. I can not reach the same level of complexity and polish but I hope to capture this sense of <span style=\"background-color: rgb(208, 255, 0);\">energy, colorful, and visual impact</span>.",
